{"path":"io/basic_ios/setstate","title":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::setstate","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>setstate","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/setstate","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Sets the stream error flags state in addition to currently set flags. Essentially calls clear(rdstate() | state). May throw an exception.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> setstate<span class=\"br0\">(</span> iostate state <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Sets the stream error flags <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">state</span></code> in addition to currently set flags. Essentially calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">clear<span class=\"br0\">(</span>rdstate<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> state<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. May throw an exception.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> state\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> stream error state flags to set. It can be a combination of the following constants:\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Constant\n</td>\n<td> Explanation\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>goodbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> no error\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>badbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> irrecoverable stream error\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>failbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> input/output operation failed (formatting or extraction error)\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>eofbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> associated input sequence has reached end-of-file\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> stream<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>stream.<span class=\"me1\">fail</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"stream is not fail<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    stream.<span class=\"me1\">setstate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1717\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">failbit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>stream.<span class=\"me1\">fail</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"now stream is fail<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span>stream.<span class=\"me1\">good</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"and stream is not good<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>stream is not fail\nnow stream is fail\nand stream is not good</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/rdstate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rdstate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns state flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/clear\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>clear</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  modifies state flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ios","title":"std::basic_ios"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::setstate","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Sets the stream error flags state in addition to currently set flags."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"state","children":[{"label":"goodbit","note":"no error"},{"label":"badbit","note":"irrecoverable stream error"},{"label":"failbit","note":"input/output operation failed (formatting or extraction error)"},{"label":"eofbit","note":"associated input sequence has reached end-of-file"}]},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"rdstate","note":"returns state flags"},{"label":"clear","note":"modifies state flags"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":138,"codeBlockCount":2}
